        (text "Robot3AxisMCU / 로봇 및 공압 제어" (at 18 18 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "f6a0ada8-5928-5a5e-b5ce-17737834af31")) (text "ESP32-S3 N16R8 · STEP/DIR/EN 3축 · 4ch relay / L298N inputs" (at 18 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.65 1.65)) (justify left)) (uuid "7795be96-09f5-58a9-8502-70a4f66b06dd")) (text "ARD / LEGACY FIRMWARE  |  2026.10.17  |  MODULE INTERCONNECT" (at 18 10 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b802c90c-761a-5cf5-916d-f080d1ed1915")) (text "읽는 법: 같은 이름의 신호 라벨은 전기적으로 연결됨. 핀 번호는 GPIO/신호명이며 커넥터 순번이 아님." (at 18 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "440909d2-721a-5244-995c-e512dafcfe79")) (text "3축 스텝 드라이버는 STEP/DIR/EN 인터페이스만 확인됨. A4988 등 정확한 모듈 형식은 미확정." (at 18 255 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "9033acc9-13bb-5696-af0b-2814d29babe6")) (text "릴레이는 active LOW, CH1/2는 주석상 공압 그리퍼. COM/NO/NC / 솔레노이드 전압 / 플라이백 회로 확인 필요." (at 18 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "543260d3-f671-519c-8ed8-18253cdae050")) (text "GPIO3/46은 부트 스트랩 핀. L298N ENA/ENB와 모터 / 전원 연결, 드라이버 전류 제한은 코드에 없음." (at 18 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "cf8ba020-e1de-5c0d-9899-d8b491daa642")) (wire (pts (xy 92.71 99.06) (xy 102.87 99.06)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "da4fbc29-9a32-58ae-9b9b-7f1212e5bb4a")) (label "R_G3" (at 102.87 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bfde1825-c608-522d-b74d-c339e8eaa478")) (wire (pts (xy 92.71 104.14) (xy 102.87 104.14)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "06a63f02-8348-5f1a-a7e1-26244d54fa77")) (label "R_G4" (at 102.87 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "42aeb6ca-c7df-5392-958c-cce0792890b1")) (wire (pts (xy 92.71 109.22) (xy 102.87 109.22)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "e6b4c934-109f-51d7-a257-1a993c6bb3e7")) (label "R_G5" (at 102.87 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70ec76d6-b